---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={"Gathering Scroll Privacy Policy - PiFl Labs"}
  description={"PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. Gathering Scroll app privacy policy"}
  canonical="https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/gathering-scroll/privacy/"
  alternates={[{"hreflang":"en","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/gathering-scroll/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ko","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/gathering-scroll/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ja","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ja/apps/gathering-scroll/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/gathering-scroll/privacy/"}]}
  extraCss={["/styles.css"]}
>
<section class="legal-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/en/" class="legal-back"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
            <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> <span class="text-gradient">Gathering Scroll Privacy Policy</span></h1>
            <p class="legal-date">Effective Date: November 16, 2026</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="legal-card">
                <p>PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. ("Company", "we", "us") is committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the iOS app <strong>Gathering Scroll</strong> ("App"). For matters not covered here, our <a href="/en/privacy">general Privacy Policy</a> applies.</p>
                <p><strong>In short</strong>: the App works without accounts, servers, ads or analytics, and it never connects to the internet. The scrolls you make are saved on your device only and are never sent to us.</p>

                <h2>1. Purpose of Processing</h2>
                <p>The App does not collect personal data on our servers. What you enter is processed only on your device, for these purposes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Making the picture</strong>: the title, subtitle, names and one-line messages you enter, and the symbols you pick, are used on the device to draw one keepsake picture for the group in the art style you choose, with a numbered copy for each person.</li>
                    <li><strong>Saving your scrolls</strong>: so you can open, change or share them again later.</li>
                    <li><strong>Sharing</strong>: when you choose to share, the finished pictures are handed to the iOS share sheet.</li>
                    <li><strong>Support</strong>: replying to inquiries you send by email.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>The App does not use the network at all. It has no accounts or sign-in, no servers, ads, analytics or crash-reporting tools, does not track you or use an advertising identifier, and has no in-app purchases.</p>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Category</th>
                            <th>Items</th>
                            <th>Handling</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Your scrolls</td>
                            <td>Title, subtitle, each person's name and one-line message (optional), the symbol chosen for each person, layout, dates</td>
                            <td>Entered by you. Saved as files in the App's own Documents folder on the device; never sent to us</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Settings</td>
                            <td>Suggested lines (on or off)</td>
                            <td>Saved in the same folder on the device</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Pictures you share</td>
                            <td>The finished pictures, which show the names and messages</td>
                            <td>Drawn on the device when you share, written to the App's temporary folder and handed to the iOS share sheet</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Inquiries</td>
                            <td>Email address and message</td>
                            <td>When you email us</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <h2>3. Retention Period</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Information on your device</strong>: until you delete the scroll or uninstall the App. We cannot access it.</li>
                    <li><strong>Device backups</strong>: if you use iCloud Backup or back up your device to a computer, these files may be included in that backup, depending on your own backup settings and Apple's policies.</li>
                    <li><strong>Email inquiries</strong>: <strong>3 years</strong> after the inquiry is resolved</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. Disclosure to Third Parties</h2>
                <p>We do not disclose personal data to third parties through the App. When you share pictures through the iOS share sheet, you choose the app and the recipient. The pictures contain the names and messages you entered, and we receive nothing.</p>

                <h2>5. Processing Entrustment</h2>
                <p>Information you enter in the App is not entrusted to anyone. Email inquiries are handled as described in our <a href="/en/privacy">general Privacy Policy</a>. The App is distributed only through the Apple App Store; information Apple handles under its own policies (such as downloads and crash reports you agree to share) is governed by Apple's privacy policy.</p>

                <h2>6. Advertising Identifier and Tracking</h2>
                <p>The App shows no ads, collects no advertising identifier and does not track you, so it does not ask for App Tracking Transparency permission.</p>

                <h2>7. App Permissions</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Add to Photos (optional)</strong>: used only when you choose "Save Image" in the share sheet, to add the picture to Photos. The App never reads your photo library.</li>
                    <li>The App does not use camera, microphone, location, contacts, notification or photo reading permissions.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>8. Data Destruction</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>On your device</strong>: deleting a saved scroll on the home screen removes it from the device immediately. Uninstalling the App removes all App data from the device. For copies in device backups, see section 3.</li>
                    <li><strong>Inquiries</strong>: permanently deleted in an unrecoverable way after the retention period.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You can view, change and delete your scrolls in the App at any time. Because App data is never sent to us, the only records we hold are email inquiries; requests about them can be sent to <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text">privacy (at) pifl-labs.com</span></a>.</p>
                <p>A scroll holds other people's names and messages. Please get their consent first, and enter only what they are happy to have on the picture.</p>

                <h2>10. Security Measures</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Scrolls and settings kept only on the device, in the App's own folder</li>
                    <li>No accounts, servers or network transfer features</li>
                    <li>Pictures drawn on the device and shared only when you choose to</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
                <p>The App is not directed at children under 14, and we collect no personal data through it. If an inquiry reveals personal data of a child under 14, we delete it promptly. Guardians may contact <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text">privacy (at) pifl-labs.com</span></a>.</p>

                <h2>12. International Data Transfers</h2>
                <p>Information you enter in the App is not transferred abroad. For email inquiries, see our <a href="/en/privacy">general Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                <h2>13. Data Protection Officer</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Company</strong>: PiFl Labs Co., Ltd.</li>
                    <li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text">privacy (at) pifl-labs.com</span></a></li>
                </ul>

                <h2>14. GDPR (European Economic Area)</h2>
                <p>If you are located in the EEA, you have additional rights under the General Data Protection Regulation, including the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, data portability, and object to processing. Contact us at <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text">privacy (at) pifl-labs.com</span></a>.</p>

                <h2>15. Changes to this Policy</h2>
                <p>This Privacy Policy is effective as of November 16, 2026. Any changes will be announced on this page.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
